---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About DailyUseCalc | Practical Everyday Calculators"
  description="Learn about DailyUseCalc and our approach to building clear, practical calculators with transparent assumptions for everyday projects."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <article class="site-container max-w-3xl py-14 sm:py-20">
    <p class="text-sm font-bold text-brand">DailyUseCalc</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-balance text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.055em] text-ink">
      About DailyUseCalc
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-ink-soft">
      DailyUseCalc provides practical calculators designed to make everyday estimates easier to
      understand.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-[0.98rem] leading-7 text-ink-soft">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink">What DailyUseCalc does</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The site currently provides a Gravel Calculator and is designed to grow with additional
          practical calculators over time. Each tool is intended to help you plan a project before
          making a purchase or starting work.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink">
          How we approach calculations
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Instead of showing only a final number, our calculators aim to make the assumptions behind
          an estimate clear. That includes the measurements, material properties, allowance, and
          practical ordering guidance that affect a result.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink">Our goal</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We want useful tools to be clear, mobile-friendly, and available without an account for
          basic calculator use. Results are estimates and should be confirmed with suppliers,
          contractors, manufacturers, or other appropriate professionals when necessary.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <a
      class="mt-10 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-control bg-brand px-5 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-strong"
      href="/gravel/">Open the Gravel Calculator</a
    >
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
